  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0527/tlg045/1st1K-grc1#tlg0527.tlg045.2.6",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0527/tlg045/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0527.tlg045.2.6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "διότι λέγει Κύριος ΙΙαντοκράτωρ Ἔτι ἅπαξ ἐγὼ σείσω τὸν οὐρανὸν καὶ τὴν γῆν καὶ τὴν θάλασσαν καὶ τὴν ξηράν,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0527/tlg045/1st1K-grc1#tlg0527.tlg045.2.7",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0527/tlg045/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0527.tlg045.2.7",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ συνσείσω πάντα τὰ ἔθνη, καὶ ἥξει τὰ ἐκλεκτὰ πάντων τῶν ἐθνῶν· καὶ πλήσω τὸν οἶκον τοῦτον δόξης, λέγει Κύριος Παντοκράτωρ.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0527/tlg045/1st1K-grc1#tlg0527.tlg045.2.8",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0527/tlg045/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0527.tlg045.2.8",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐμὸν τὸ ἀργύριον καὶ ἐμὸν τὸ χρυσίον, λέγει Κύριος αντοκράτωρ.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
